import{_ as n,o as t,c as s,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 836 | Transcended Ones and Education | The Transcended One's Lineage-Transmission Mechanism","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 836 | Transcended Ones and Education | The Transcended One's Lineage-Transmission Mechanism","no":836,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Lineage-Transmission Mechanism","Apprentice System","Lineage Continuity","Post Succession"],"related":["720-Transcended-One Training and Lineage Post","710-The Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm as a Perpetual-Post Realm","781-The Transcended One's Myriad-Rank Education Duty","25-Symbiotic-Feedback-Cycle Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0836_模块4-超脱者与教育-传承机制.md","filePath":"en/0836_模块4-超脱者与教育-传承机制.md"}`),o={name:"en/0836_模块4-超脱者与教育-传承机制.md"};function a(r,e,l,h,c,d){return t(),s("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-836-transcended-ones-and-education-the-transcended-one-s-lineage-transmission-mechanism" tabindex="-1">Entry 836 | Transcended Ones and Education | The Transcended One&#39;s Lineage-Transmission Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-836-transcended-ones-and-education-the-transcended-one-s-lineage-transmission-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 836 | Transcended Ones and Education | The Transcended One&#39;s Lineage-Transmission Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 25, 710, 720, 781</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-lineage-does-not-die-with-the-person-is-the-transcended-one-s-transmission-first-principle" tabindex="-1">Introduction: lineage does not die with the person is the transcended one&#39;s transmission first principle <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-lineage-does-not-die-with-the-person-is-the-transcended-one-s-transmission-first-principle" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: lineage does not die with the person is the transcended one&#39;s transmission first principle&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world&#39;s most bitter loss is not war, but &quot;person dies Dao extinguishes&quot; — what one strong one spent a lifetime comprehending goes with him into the grave; later-comers must stumble over the same pit anew. Heng Yuan Zhou was able to push civilization to the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm not by some strong one&#39;s dramatic emergence, but by a <strong>lineage-transmission mechanism that lets the Dao flow perpetually.</strong> This entry does not discuss the academy (that is batch cultivation), but specifically discusses &quot;how the Dao itself is transmitted among transcended ones, between transcended ones and later-comers&quot; — transmission mechanism&#39;s legal basis, structure, and anti-generation-break design.</p><p>Six top-level axioms simultaneously take the stage: <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> requires transmission not hide private things, not run &quot;transmit inside not outside&quot;; <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong> requires transmission face all qualified ones, not choose inheritors by bloodline or sect; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> requires transmission&#39;s purpose be letting later-comers stand on predecessors&#39; shoulders to continue uplift, not becoming predecessors&#39; shadows; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires the transmission process leave traces, preventing &quot;off-track lineage&quot; from polluting descendants; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires the transmission mechanism itself be a stable self-consistent law-level institution, not collapsing due to personal handover.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-transmission-mechanism-s-three-layer-structure" tabindex="-1">I. The Transmission Mechanism&#39;s Three-Layer Structure <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-transmission-mechanism-s-three-layer-structure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Transmission Mechanism&#39;s Three-Layer Structure&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s transcended-one transmission divides into three layers simultaneously, none dispensable:</p><ol><li><strong>Knowledge-layer transmission — textbook network</strong>: the transcended one&#39;s insights must be textbook-ified, deposited into the Selfless Dao&#39;s public textbook library. This layer does not depend on any specific person; anyone may retrieve. This is &quot;the Dao does not extinguish&quot;&#39;s chassis.</li><li><strong>Method-layer transmission — master-apprentice mentoring</strong>: textbooks alone cannot teach the &quot;feel.&quot; Every on-post transcended one bears a fixed apprentice quota (baseline 3–5 per term), hand-in-hand bringing later-comers through key breakthrough points — those judgments textbooks cannot fully write, only felt in real decisions.</li><li><strong>Post-layer transmission — succession handover</strong>: the transcended one as a Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm perpetual-post officeholder (entry 710), his post duty is not private estate, may not be &quot;his when he dies.&quot; The post must have a succession echelon; before leaving the post, complete knowledge, authority, and relationship-network full handover.</li></ol><p>Three layers stack: the knowledge layer ensures &quot;the Dao does not extinguish&quot;; the method layer ensures &quot;the Dao is learnable&quot;; the post layer ensures &quot;the post is not vacant.&quot; The old world only had the second layer (and did it poorly), the third layer completely absent — so once a strong one falls, the whole system empties.</p><h2 id="ii-succession-system-a-post-is-not-private-estate-may-not-be-monopolized" tabindex="-1">II. Succession System: A Post Is Not Private Estate, May Not Be Monopolized <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-succession-system-a-post-is-not-private-estate-may-not-be-monopolized" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Succession System: A Post Is Not Private Estate, May Not Be Monopolized&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transmission mechanism&#39;s hardest rule is <strong>the post-succession system.</strong> It must answer a question the old world never answered: when a transcended one &quot;retires&quot; or &quot;ascends,&quot; who takes his post?</p><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer is: post-echelon system. Every transcended post has 1 principal, 2–3 alternates, several reserves; alternates auto-promote through post rotation and civilizational-weight assessment. When the principal leaves, follow the standard handover process:</p><ul><li>Authority transfer: law-anchor authority, Alaya-Network supervision authority, cross-plane dispatch authority transfer per procedure, no back doors left;</li><li>Relationship transfer: Myriad-Rank clan representatives, cross-plane anchor contacts, in-progress project list, item-by-item handover;</li><li>Cognition transfer: unwritten judgments, historical pitfalls, unresolved contradictions, archived in &quot;successor memorandum&quot; form.</li></ul><p>This directly seals the old world&#39;s &quot;sole decision over eons&quot; mode — you leave, the post remains, order does not collapse.</p><h2 id="iii-why-not-run-a-single-inheritor" tabindex="-1">III. Why Not Run a &quot;Single Inheritor&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-why-not-run-a-single-inheritor" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Why Not Run a &quot;Single Inheritor&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world favors &quot;the sole inheritor&quot;: an unparalleled strong one transmits his lifelong cultivation and robe-bowl only to one disciple. Heng Yuan Zhou explicitly opposes:</p><ul><li><strong>Single-point failure risk</strong>: if the sole inheritor midway goes astray, falls, or has corrupt heart-nature, the whole lineage breaks. This is betting civilization&#39;s future on one person.</li><li><strong>Heart-nature monopoly risk</strong>: the sole inheritor is indoctrinated from childhood with &quot;you are heaven-chosen&quot;; extremely easy to breed beings&#39; origin greed · short-cut inner demon and &quot;protagonist-uniqueness dependency.&quot;</li><li><strong>Myriad-Rank exclusion risk</strong>: choosing only one inheritor equals excluding all other qualified ones among Myriad Ranks.</li></ul><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s approach is <strong>multiple mentoring, echelon succession, open competition.</strong> Lineage is not some person&#39;s &quot;inheritance,&quot; but a public river — anyone may flow in, no one may monopolize.</p><h2 id="iv-transmission-and-causal-self-discipline-preventing-off-track-lineage-from-polluting-descendants" tabindex="-1">IV. Transmission and Causal Self-Discipline: Preventing &quot;Off-Track Lineage&quot; from Polluting Descendants <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-transmission-and-causal-self-discipline-preventing-off-track-lineage-from-polluting-descendants" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Transmission and Causal Self-Discipline: Preventing &quot;Off-Track Lineage&quot; from Polluting Descendants&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Transmission is cross-generational causal operation. If some transcended one&#39;s insights carry untested bias, even residual predatory thinking, and he transmits it without textbook-ification and supervision, it will pollute generation after generation of later-comers. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s solution:</p><ul><li>Before textbooks enter the library, they must pass Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision&#39;s &quot;ethics and self-consistency review&quot;; content conflicting with fundamental laws may not enter the library;</li><li>The apprentice-mentoring process throughout leaves traces; the master&#39;s every key guidance is traceable; once the master is found to go astray, cut the pollution chain in time;</li><li>The student has the right to raise objection to the master&#39;s guidance, submitting to the Symbiotic Court for review — the student is not the master&#39;s private estate.</li></ul><p>This way, transmission is not &quot;replicating another me,&quot; but &quot;handing the tested Dao to a younger, possibly stronger generation.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: three-layer transmission lets one insight flow perpetually, eliminating &quot;person dies Dao extinguishes&quot; — the old world&#39;s largest energy-level waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: multiple mentoring, open competition, seal &quot;single inheritor&quot;-style lineage monopoly; knowledge layer opens network-wide</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system&#39;s Dao through Gu Chensha&#39;s one-time grace to Tang Luo; no echelon, no succession; once the protagonist changes, generations break; Heng Yuan Zhou uses post-echelon system to let lineage be perpetual</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: transmission faces all qualified ones, not selected by bloodline or sect; alternates selected from Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: textbook layer opens network-wide, succession standards and handover process public, Alaya supervision queryable</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s transmission mechanism answers &quot;how does civilization not regress when a strong one dies.&quot; It uses knowledge-layer, method-layer, post-layer triple structure; uses echelon succession to replace single inheritor; uses Alaya supervision to cut off off-track lineage. Lineage is no longer some person&#39;s private estate, but a public river Myriad Ranks jointly build and flow perpetually. When the strongest ages, retires, uplifts, while the Dao and post are perpetual, civilization truly owns a future not kidnapped by any individual&#39;s fate.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/720_模块4-超脱者培训与传承岗.html">Entry 720 · Transcended-One Training and Lineage Post</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/710_模块4-衡锚超多元境作为永久岗位境.html">Entry 710 · The Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm as a Perpetual-Post Realm</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/781_模块4-万族-超脱者的教育责任.html">Entry 781 · The Transcended One&#39;s Myriad-Rank Education Duty</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/25-共生反馈循环机制.html">Entry 25 · Symbiotic-Feedback-Cycle Mechanism</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const m=n(o,[["render",a]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
